  "Paredes exteriores y siding: soft wash con detergentes profesionales — remueve moho y algas sin forzar el material ni la pintura.": "Exterior walls and siding: soft wash with professional detergents — removes mold and algae without stressing the material or paint.",
  "Madera y coralina": "Wood and coral",
